    full export, in order), read from ``FILE`` or standard input when the
    argument is ``-``. Prints a single JSON line:
    ``{"ok": true, "checkpoint": {...}}`` on success or
    ``{"ok": false, "error": "input"|"integrity"}`` on failure, and exits
    0/1 respectively.
